          "name": "Retrieve company intent data",
          "request": {
            "name": "Retrieve company intent data",
            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves company intent signals filtered by company IDs, keyword set IDs, or keywords within a specified time range.\n\nYou can optionally filter by intent strength or the number of people researching and control pagination and sorting. At least one of `companyIds`, `keywordSetIds`, or `keywords` is required.",
